{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "665657dd9aa3f074323f255c07a9e726833839c173722d0083e0e4f5fb68551a", "ja": "たくさん『せーふく』できた？", "zh": "有好好『征服』很多地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "21f867ef79fa1488ec6d84339a9f44d3363af71ba774e0d7320ccc54d7f904f7", "ja": "以前『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』で共演した\n子ども達と再会！　みんな、あの時できなか\nったことや苦手だったものをちゃんと乗り越\nえ、『せーふく』していた。ちょっと会わな\nい間に大きくなったね！", "zh": "与之前在《☆噼啪星球☆》中合作过的\n孩子们重逢了！大家都好好克服了那时没能\n做到的事和不擅长的东西，已经『征服』了。\n一段时间没见，都长大了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "0ee774f9631b712abd43fbaa67ab24500459489d29bacc5a94dc5245e37750a3", "ja": "ピピッ！　杏奈達の宇宙船、\nスペースコブン号に、地球のみんなをご招待～♪", "zh": "哔哔！欢迎地球上的大家登上杏奈她们的宇宙飞船——スペースコブン号～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "26f14b2ad781084b6a876a08bd1dc8a128f48cbd867a338276ba67d698eff8c6", "ja": "わーい！　前も一緒に遊んでくれた\nお友達のみんなに、集まってもらったぞ～！", "zh": "哇——！把之前也跟环一起玩过的\n小伙伴们，都叫到这里来集合啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "f2d3d9d542165d391a102705f368f1c5e5634eaa16b6379f15b906555adabed4", "ja": "みんな、元気にご挨拶できるかな～！？\nせーのっ！", "zh": "大家能精神饱满地打招呼吗～！？\n预备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "c09c08eb5a241a9a662ac4dea938dd80e7da095486e5c5003133faeee0753bf7", "ja": "はーい、みんなよくできました！", "zh": "好——大家都做得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1008_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "21823b62557fd1c6b43bc81b233a980f21f4390698d1557d537a2ad948f7428c", "ja": "おはよう！　おはよう！　おはよう！", "zh": "早上好！早上好！早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "ac7604f767c426fbc1e253e472411b4d3dbf276ca2ec4e5b1dcb24bbef625e14", "ja": "はい、おはようさんです。\nふふ……みんな元気みたいで、よかったよぉ。", "zh": "是的，早上好呀。\n呵呵……大家好像都很有精神，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "68a303dd0d7fa44b4788bb37546035dad5382eac1cf8bfbed06cf0eebcc95ae9", "ja": "みんな、たまきたちが見てなくても\nちゃんと毎日『せーふく』してたかな？", "zh": "大家，就算环她们没看着，\n每天也有好好去“征服”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "75b7dab5dfee1b8a8f3b5b05a5c7e0a43c623f2203e2bf9de8998bbd512fe60e", "ja": "みんなが『せーふく』できたもの、\nおねーさんたちに教えてくれるかい？", "zh": "大家『征服』了什么，\n可以告诉大姐姐们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1012_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "8edbfcc2884c4644d2c0a28fc9793bcb234363244215600e561e692aa244c948", "ja": "ぼく、はみがきを『せーふく』した！", "zh": "我成功“征服”刷牙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1013_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "48e8b0b28daaed113d4d1a0d19accee62a18734c49592f3863a215877d839db7", "ja": "ブロッコリーを『せーふく』したよ！", "zh": "我把西兰花“制服”啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1014_gametoannnagasukinako", "source_sha256": "463a81bf42540bd70189e0a4cfa0ecf25dc9334895309ebb26a28d7414325010", "ja": "杏奈お姉ちゃんにおすすめされたゲーム、\n『せーふく』したよ！", "zh": "杏奈姐姐推荐的游戏，我“征服”啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "2c62fb70c4ddad1544bab8350c91bf2a17b93087499492852d6c2ec4e518fbb9", "ja": "えっ、ほんと？　すごーい！　よーし、\nじゃあ対戦しようよ！　杏奈も負けないぞ☆", "zh": "诶，真的吗？好厉害——！好——，那我们来对战吧！杏奈也不会输的哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "7c13dcd4704f27168b225a966e8bdb8b9f20a1cb23d39f82f218e9768e1e9b64", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、杏奈ちゃん。\nゲームはあとあと。今は収録中だからねぇ。", "zh": "杏奈，杏奈。\n游戏待会儿再玩。现在还在录制中呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "a3560c9b4ffccad04bb6b12d26bcb3420541bd21bc2573fc39f87aee0bfa567b", "ja": "はっ！？　そうだった……！", "zh": "哈！？对哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1018_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "b3c8ea9c087595921c7c297703ee92867d0f97a4ba4323f9dd2eb8025afad605", "ja": "星梨花おねーちゃん。\nわたしね、ワンちゃんと一緒に暮らしはじめたんだよ。", "zh": "星梨花姐姐。  \n我呀，开始和小狗一起生活了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1019_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "237a3ec7a7f37ca3325c31801833bb5804a05abb9bbf48204f2d25c97a8a28e1", "ja": "最初はワンちゃん苦手だったけど……\nでもジュニオールと遊んだのが、楽しくて。", "zh": "一开始我不太擅长和狗狗相处……\n但是和Junior一起玩，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1020_kiyowanaonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "dac49924193ba8452837edd0b5f13eb02fdb665a9ccb0708e9d20229ced5ca6a", "ja": "羨ましくなってお父さんに頼んだの。\nとってもかわいくて……いいコなの！", "zh": "我羡慕得不得了，就拜托爸爸了。\n特别可爱……是个好孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "d6622e97d28496a85e633150ecd21bccf032bb9ad667f8a8384c315f36f74c55", "ja": "わぁ……！　えへへ、うれしいなぁ。\nみんな、すごく『せーふく』してるんだね。", "zh": "哇……！嘿嘿，好开心呀。\n大家都穿着特别漂亮的“制服”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "7fece1203ccacaded9001ea1e04ebdfb5a8cbcbe81a5d75e73f681c1577ffd40", "ja": "ちょっと会わないうちに、\nみんな、大人になっていくんだねぇ……。", "zh": "才没见多久，大家都在慢慢长大了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc87bf09a34cdf5d3ad0e3ff37dfb440e8a54b9ed0658fe6305e3866acf86efe", "ja": "うわ～っ！？　このままじゃ、\nたまき、みんなに追い越されちゃうよ～！", "zh": "呜哇～！？这样下去的话，环，感觉要被大家超过了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "e375f758ab72c9016c75e3898e88f075404404eb8bd85ea321abb7ae9750fa33", "ja": "ビビッ！　それはきっと、相対性理論でアール！\n光の速さに近づくほど、時間は遅く流れるのでアール。", "zh": "哔哔！那一定就是相对论啦！越接近光速，时间流逝得就越慢哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "40d8e020aaf26141567bb76e6ec0424e72944b5c579072689a98192b42537687", "ja": "スペースコブン号で旅を続ける杏奈達は、\n地球のお友達より、大人になるのが遅いのでアール！", "zh": "乘坐太空科布恩号继续旅行的杏奈她们，会比地球上的朋友们更晚长大哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "05df093c92773c86ac8a6fe5ac388819363fc0d3fc3a2e643ed7695408018f17", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなの、どうしたら……\nわたし達も、みんなと大人になりたいよ～！", "zh": "诶！？那种事，要怎么办才好……我们也想和大家一起长大呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "72829f3ec117cb489bda25e6aa59d6c375707be1ca9e0cf8f4a85f08ea4f3dc4", "ja": "うーん……したっけ、みんなで鬼ごっことか、\nかけっこをして、たくさん遊ぶのはどうだろか？", "zh": "嗯……那大家一起玩捉人游戏、赛跑之类的，好好玩一场怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "2089b9dd0007b404af67afdbbea9779c29289641e50c34373e17eb94e809d5c1", "ja": "そっか！　みんながすばやく動けば、時間がゆっくり\n流れるのでアール！　ひなた、ナイスでアール♪", "zh": "原来如此！大家只要动作快一点，时间就会流得慢一点！日向，干得漂亮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "3958f64608e4d8af8af1f6707617fd2cb9500b39a19788542a2d6f8a643ac0ce", "ja": "たまき、その理由はちょっとわからないけど……。\nでも、いっぱい遊ぶのは得意だぞ～！", "zh": "环，其实不太明白那个理由……  \n不过，要说尽情玩耍的话，我可是很擅长的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "2874b94e612aa3e25f4469483edb0ad6d36e9f58d13c505eddf11a2c923b5cd2", "ja": "それならこの後、お歌とダンスのコーナーがあるね。\nみんな～、すばやく動いて時間を超越してね～！", "zh": "这样的话，接下来就是唱歌跳舞环节了呢。\n大家——要迅速行动，超越时间哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0261_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_03_1031_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "0ecbdaa0bc9a946a6aa7d424563849a01af3d760613aee4ba12dc517cebc0236", "ja": "はーい！！", "zh": "好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
